    mir_enum_payload_inline_dict_literal_key_annotation_mismatch_2026-11-14, 0, "pure-Simple MIR lower_declared_enum_payload_expression previously treated HIR DictLit Infer(0, 0) key type as an explicit annotation and rejected inline SdnValue.Dict({...}) literals with enum payload dictionary key annotation mismatch. Fixed via enum_payload_dict_key_is_ascribed and enum_payload_dict_entry_nil_vetoed in src/compiler/50.mir/_MirLoweringExpr/enum_constructor_payload.spl:54-71, 417-438; src/lib workarounds retired in 1ce67b65c87; waiting-for: native Phase 2/3 compiler build verification."

